<title>USA: Coca-Cola Bottling sees solid growth accelerating.</title>
<headline>Coca-Cola Bottling sees solid growth accelerating.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coca-Cola Bottling Co Consolidated said on Friday that its core brands all had solid sales growth during 1996, and those trends have accelerated during the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>Sprite in particular grew rapidly during 1996, achieving a double-digit pace, the company said.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
